  "title": "Standard Integrals",
  "titleBn": "প্রমাণ যোগজীকরণ সূত্রসমূহ",
  "summary": "Power, exponential, logarithmic, trigonometric ও inverse-trigonometric standard integrals।",
  "latex": "\\int x^n dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C,\\quad\\int\\frac{dx}{x}=\\ln|x|+C,\\quad\\int e^x dx=e^x+C",
